{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":61618,\"title\":\"Liar Game\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Various contestants take part in a game show with a prize of 10 billion won wherein contestants are encouraged to cheat and lie. The contestants who are able to cheat the others win the prizes but be in debt if he/she loses the game. Contestants include genius swindler Cha Woo-jin and naive college student Nam Da-jung. Meanwhile, Kang Do-young will play the MC and planner of this game show.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v29vqIeeKlPfIFYQeDbLJlHkUH7.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rByaZ1ogqEAcgacWl5lC5o75HrY.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":20,\"year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":12,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"tvN\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"KR\",\"name\":\"South Korea\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2014-11-25\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3146131,\"name\":\"Kim Hong-sun\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":117508,\"name\":\"Kim So-eun\",\"character\":\"Nam Da-jung\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xqqnT9Sgvm9sTufg5jTEdGQnv0z.jpg\"},{\"id\":1257610,\"name\":\"Lee Sang-yun\",\"character\":\"Ha Woo-jin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kxLb9xvL94Q4Z6ELYU8OLjVzZCZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1257661,\"name\":\"EL\",\"character\":\"Oh Jung-ah / Jamie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4AkevGu4IoGiWEeq46nX3pvByWO.jpg\"},{\"id\":1335825,\"name\":\"Shin Sung-rok\",\"character\":\"Kang Do-young\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ajwIMcTc2jVFsjVOx2W0XARxpj.jpg\"},{\"id\":1257669,\"name\":\"Uhm Hyo-seop\",\"character\":\"Da-jung's father\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vCHrubcNvkaOnCI2DkHcRwdM7Q.jpg\"},{\"id\":1487428,\"name\":\"Jang Seung-jo\",\"character\":\"Kim Bong-geun\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3HWGHh4Zazo4